---

TASK: Generate a complete, professional tech pack for the following garment specification.
This will be printed and sent to manufacturers — it must be accurate and production-ready.

GARMENT SPEC:
{{ spec | tojson(indent=2) }}

GENERATE:
1. description — Professional garment description (2-3 sentences, factory-ready language)
2. construction_details — Step-by-step construction sequence
3. bom — Bill of Materials: every fabric, lining, interfacing, zipper, button, thread, label
   Each BOM item: { item, quantity (with unit), specification (weight/grade/color) }
4. measurements_chart — Size S/M/L/XL grid with all key measurements in cm
5. stitching_specs — Stitch type, SPI (stitches per inch), thread tension for each seam type
6. care_instructions — ISO care symbols descriptions + written instructions
7. compliance_notes — Any relevant standards (OEKO-TEX, BIS, export requirements)
8. wash_care — Single-line care instruction for label
9. label_content — Brand label content template
10. packaging_notes — Folding, tagging, poly-bag, carton specifications
11. qc_checkpoints — Quality control inspection points (min 10 checkpoints)

RULES:
- Use industry-standard terminology
- Be specific about measurements and specifications
- No vague terms like "as required" — give actual values
- Return ONLY valid JSON
